(dof6-bank-maneuver)
*title Native rigid-body bank authority and roll moment response
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=2.0 reference-length=1.0 inertia-x=5 inertia-y=6 inertia-z=7 dry-mass-kg=25
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=200 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=180
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control bank-deg default=25.0 lower=-45.0 upper=45.0 slew=30

*trajectory 1 bank-test start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6379000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=120 zdt=0 qw=0.7071068 qz=0.7071068 time=0 mass=25 propellant_mass=0
  *segment 1 bank
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly bankgc=25
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
